reviewTips.suggestion:
[重构思路] 先把待比较值统一归一化为字符串（或在 JSON 场景下按 jsonPath 取值），对每种 matchMethod 分别做类型判断，并把异常正则/不支持的方法降级为明确的失败原因而不是抛错。代码示例：`const candidate = typeof payload === "string" ? payload : JSON.stringify(payload);
const matchers = { equal: (a, b) => a === b, include: (a, b) => a.includes(b), regex: (a, b) => new RegExp(b).test(a) };
const fn = matchers[matchMethod ?? "equal"];
if (!fn) { httpResponse.status = false; httpResponse.message = \`Unsupported matchMethod: \${matchMethod}\`; return httpResponse; }"

[重构思路] 保留原始 code，把断言失败表达在 status 与 message 上（可另加一个 assertion 字段），不要篡改观测字段。代码示例：`if (!ok) {
  httpResponse.status = false;
  httpResponse.message = \`Expected value not matched (\${matchMethod})\`;
  httpResponse.assertion = { matchMethod, expectedValue, matched: false };
  return httpResponse;
}`

[重构思路] 给出明确的缺省策略并记录未知取值：matchMethod 为空时回退到 "equal"（与前端 Select 的 `value={monitor.matchMethod || "equal"}` 一致），未知取值时返回带 message 的失败并 warn 日志。代码示例：`const method = matchMethod || "equal";
if (!["equal","include","regex"].includes(method)) {
  this.logger.warn({ message: \`Unknown matchMethod \${matchMethod}\`, service: this.SERVICE_NAME, method: "requestHttp" });
}`

[重构思路] 把「取值」与「断言」解耦：先用 jsonPath 从 payload 提取 target（无 jsonPath 时 target = payload），再对 target 做一致化后的匹配，并保留原有的 httpNotJson/httpJsonPathError 分支。代码示例：`let target = payload;
if (jsonPath) {
  try { target = this.jmespath.search(payload, jsonPath); }
  catch { httpResponse.status = false; httpResponse.message = this.stringService.httpJsonPathError; return httpResponse; }
}
if (expectedValue) return this.applyAssertion(httpResponse, target, matchMethod, expectedValue);`

[重构思路] 增加迁移记录集合（记录已执行的 migration id）实现幂等；迁移内部使用单条 updateMany 做原子换算；失败时以 error 级别日志抛出，让 connect 显式失败或明确降级提示。代码示例：`const done = await Migration.findOne({ name: "0001_statusWindowThreshold" });
if (done) return;
await Monitor.updateMany({ statusWindowThreshold: { $lt: 1 } }, [{ $set: { statusWindowThreshold: { $multiply: ["$statusWindowThreshold", 100] } } }]);
await Migration.create({ name: "0001_statusWindowThreshold", appliedAt: new Date() });`

[重构思路] 在组件内部对 config 做解构默认，或显式 merge。代码示例：`const DataTable = ({ headers = [], data = [], config = {} }) => {
  const { emptyView = "No data", tooltipContent = null, onRowClick, rowSX } = config;
  ...
}`，调用方无需重复传默认值。

[重构思路] 明确渲染契约：让 tooltipContent 接收 row 并返回 React 元素，但把 theme 提升到组件层或用纯函数的方式获取主题；或者把 GetTooltip 写成真正的组件并用 JSX 调用 `<GetTooltip row={row} />`。代码示例：`// Table/index.jsx
title={typeof tooltipContent === "function" ? <tooltipContent row={row} /> : tooltipContent}

// IncidentTable
const TooltipContent = ({ row }) => { const theme = useTheme(); ... }`
